WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:03.110
I always believe that I can't share my sadness.

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:07.669
You must have seen my videos, they are fun,
entertaining, humorous.

00:00:07.669 --> 00:00:10.359
And my videos always start with a smile.

00:00:10.359 --> 00:00:14.320
But in today's video, I have something that
I can't tell you with a smile.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.021
You must have seen the title and thumbnail.

00:00:16.021 --> 00:00:19.401
And if you are watching this video, then definitely I am alive.

00:00:26.361 --> 00:00:30.289
Now you must be thinking that what is so big that
I am talking about living and dying.

00:00:30.289 --> 00:00:33.771
Look, this is not a recent news, this is 5 months old.

00:00:33.771 --> 00:00:36.293
And seriously, after seeing the title and thumbnail,

00:00:36.293 --> 00:00:41.613
Many of you will say that I met you,
I was with you, still you didn't share.

00:00:41.613 --> 00:00:44.600
Then definitely my answer is that I don't feel like sharing sadness.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:47.799
Very rarely, very limited and closed
people know about this thing.

00:00:47.799 --> 00:00:49.358
And maybe I am not even making this video,

00:00:49.358 --> 00:00:52.323
But there are some things with me that I want to share.

00:00:52.323 --> 00:00:55.507
And obviously, if it benefits people,
Then what is better than that.

00:00:55.507 --> 00:00:57.101
So let me tell you a little back story.

00:00:57.101 --> 00:01:01.746
On 7th August, we purchased Mahindra XUV900
and posted it on social media.

00:01:01.746 --> 00:01:03.477
People congratulated us a lot.

00:01:03.477 --> 00:01:08.647
And as a boy, you will be able to relate that
a car is a special purchase for a boy.

00:01:08.647 --> 00:01:10.615
Of course, it is for everyone, but specifically for boys,

00:01:10.615 --> 00:01:12.603
They have a different love for cars.

00:01:12.603 --> 00:01:17.215
Whether they buy it or not, a friend buys a car or whatever,
Their happiness is at a different level.

00:01:17.215 --> 00:01:19.640
On top of that, it is such an expensive purchase.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:23.251
And the reason why we chose XEV-9E
was that it is a tech-loaded car.

00:01:23.251 --> 00:01:25.179
Secondly, it is an EV because I already had a fuel car.

00:01:25.179 --> 00:01:27.925
So I thought it will contribute towards the environment.

00:01:27.925 --> 00:01:30.596
Then we posted a review of it and got a lot of love.

00:01:30.596 --> 00:01:32.622
In that, I covered all its tech features.

00:01:32.622 --> 00:01:36.015
And I still get comments in that video
that how detailed that video was.

00:01:36.015 --> 00:01:37.850
Whereas, it was my first car review.

00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:42.040
And I used this car as much as I showed in that video.

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:46.394
Because when this car came, initially there were
small issues in it, which I shared on Twitter.

00:01:46.394 --> 00:01:48.480
Some limited people had seen that tweet as well.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:52.418
There were some body paint issues, pen marks on the seat,
and other small technical issues.

00:01:52.418 --> 00:01:55.406
Then they got sorted and they
asked me to remove the tweet.

00:01:55.406 --> 00:01:57.480
I thought it was not a big issue, so I removed it.

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.040
This went on for 3-4 days.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:02.319
Then the tech review that I was telling you about,
it went on for 7 days.

00:02:02.319 --> 00:02:05.785
And then I gave this car for PPF,
in that as well, 4-5 days passed on.

00:02:05.785 --> 00:02:10.560
And in total, I haven't even drove
this car for around 100 KMs.

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:12.565
And the evening when I got my car back after PPF,

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:15.545
I felt that it has been a long time so let's travel with it.

00:02:15.545 --> 00:02:17.172
Me and my friend went to Maggi point,

00:02:17.172 --> 00:02:20.393
Those who have been to Dehradun-Masuri will know
that there are many Maggi points on the way.

00:02:20.393 --> 00:02:23.857
We ate something there, and we were just
coming back through Old Masuri Road.

00:02:23.857 --> 00:02:27.722
And there is a sharp U-shaped turn,
from where a car was coming from the wrong side.

00:02:27.722 --> 00:02:30.840
I steered a little to the left,
And the car went straight into the Gorge.

00:02:39.932 --> 00:02:42.599
And the first credit goes to the durability of the car.

00:02:42.599 --> 00:02:46.143
After such a big accident, I didn't even get a scratch.

00:02:46.143 --> 00:02:49.212
This happened on 29th August, and from that day till today,

00:02:49.212 --> 00:02:52.183
I am active on social media, gaming channel,

00:02:52.183 --> 00:02:54.699
And I am making content for my tech channel as well.

00:02:54.699 --> 00:02:58.656
I didn't even get a scratch on my head
despite having a glass moonroof.

00:02:58.656 --> 00:03:02.840
All the airbags were open,
And when this happened, I was in shock.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:04.854
Because when the accident happened,
I didn't realize one thing.

00:03:04.854 --> 00:03:09.061
But after some seconds,
I realized that the car is upside down.

00:03:09.061 --> 00:03:12.394
Thank God, the side on which the car fell,
there was water just next to it,

00:03:12.394 --> 00:03:14.439
And it could have gone into the water as well.

00:03:14.439 --> 00:03:17.640
The biggest thing is that it was an EV vehicle,
and we could have got an electric shock as well.

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:22.919
And we don't even know how deep the water was,
so things could have been worse for us.

00:03:22.919 --> 00:03:28.693
But I thank God that I was saved,
And there would be your blessings as well.

00:03:28.693 --> 00:03:30.919
So that I am sitting in front of you even
after such a major crash

00:03:30.919 --> 00:03:32.369
And there was a feature of the car,

00:03:32.369 --> 00:03:34.594
Emergency call was made automatically through the car,

00:03:34.594 --> 00:03:36.125
I talked on the call

00:03:36.125 --> 00:03:38.801
And they took our location and sent the police there.

00:03:38.801 --> 00:03:39.919
The police also came immediately.

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:41.069
Now, who is at fault here?

00:03:41.069 --> 00:03:44.216
First, the one who was coming on the wrong side.

00:03:44.216 --> 00:03:48.982
Other than that, big thanks to the police and the
locals who helped in rescuing us and the car.

00:03:48.982 --> 00:03:52.919
Because the Gorge was very deep,
And it seemed impossible for us to come up from there.

00:03:52.919 --> 00:03:56.384
And the government infrastructure is also very poor.

00:03:56.384 --> 00:04:01.487
Because that U-shaped turn, I will show you the
Google map image, you can see how sharp it is.

00:04:01.487 --> 00:04:05.722
And you must have seen in the hilly areas,
there are barricades of metal or concrete.

00:04:05.722 --> 00:04:09.183
And when the accident happened, do you know
what the locals were saying while rescuing us?

00:04:09.183 --> 00:04:10.352
That this happens here almost everyday.

00:04:10.352 --> 00:04:12.071
And after that, I took some photos.

00:04:12.071 --> 00:04:15.562
In this specific portion,
There were no barricades from where my car fell.

00:04:15.562 --> 00:04:16.739
If this barricade had been there,

00:04:16.739 --> 00:04:19.920
Then my car would have just got stuck there and
there wouldn't have been such a big accident.

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:22.258
And the most surprising thing is that after 3-4 days,

00:04:22.258 --> 00:04:26.597
I went to the insurance officer to show him the location
when he had to do the inspection.

00:04:26.597 --> 00:04:29.851
If you compare my 3-4 days old photo,
there are barricades ahead.

00:04:29.851 --> 00:04:32.920
But that day, 2-3 barricades ahead were also missing.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:35.160
That is, there have been accidents
even after my accident.

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:37.920
Look, even after so many accidents,
The government is not taking any action there.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:38.993
And this is just an example.

00:04:38.993 --> 00:04:43.920
There are millions of such examples where
people lose their lives just because of infrastructure.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.016
You must be aware of the case of Noida,
which happened recently.

00:04:46.016 --> 00:04:47.172
A boy drowned and died.

00:04:47.172 --> 00:04:49.559
Now, after all this, comes the insurance company.

00:04:49.559 --> 00:04:53.355
Now, when we came out of there,
I called the insurance company first.

00:04:53.355 --> 00:04:54.863
That we need roadside assistance.

00:04:54.863 --> 00:04:56.346
We have to get the car out.

00:04:56.346 --> 00:05:00.223
They directly refused that if the car has gone into
the gorge, then we will not be able to help.

00:05:00.223 --> 00:05:02.124
We only provide roadside assistance.

00:05:02.124 --> 00:05:03.909
I also did some research about this.

00:05:03.909 --> 00:05:06.432
Yes, insurance companies do not provide cranes etc.

00:05:06.432 --> 00:05:09.143
But it was night time, at least they could have helped.

00:05:09.143 --> 00:05:10.503
But they didn't even ask anything like that.

00:05:10.503 --> 00:05:12.540
They just refused that we don't have service.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:15.461
And big thanks to that police officer who was standing with us.

00:05:15.461 --> 00:05:17.325
He gave us the number of the crane operator.

00:05:17.325 --> 00:05:20.793
And the crane operator asked us for Rs 20,000 to come there.

00:05:20.793 --> 00:05:22.680
Now, I have Rs 20,000.

00:05:22.701 --> 00:05:27.559
If there is a person who doesn't have the money on the
spot at that time in such a situation.

00:05:27.559 --> 00:05:29.194
Neither cash nor in bank account.

00:05:29.194 --> 00:05:31.257
He will have a lot of problems.

00:05:31.257 --> 00:05:33.195
And the best part, that police officer said,

00:05:33.195 --> 00:05:35.740
Until the crane does not come, I am standing here with you.

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:37.414
Then we told him that no sir, you can go.

00:05:37.414 --> 00:05:38.157
We will do it.

00:05:38.157 --> 00:05:41.485
And it took 3-4 hours for the crane to reach the location.

00:05:41.485 --> 00:05:43.920
And obviously, I couldn't leave my car and go there.

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:45.113
That I will see it tomorrow.

00:05:45.113 --> 00:05:46.715
This is India, There would be nothing by the morning.

00:05:46.715 --> 00:05:47.593
Then the crane came.

00:05:47.593 --> 00:05:49.554
We took the car out of the crane.

00:05:49.554 --> 00:05:52.267
And we took it to Mahindra's workshop in a tow truck.

00:05:52.267 --> 00:05:54.810
And this was the same truck that ICICI Lombard sent.

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:57.180
Now, after such a big accident, after such a condition of the car.

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:59.567
As a boy or as a new car owner.

00:05:59.567 --> 00:06:01.705
He will think that I will not drive this car.

00:06:01.705 --> 00:06:04.307
First of all, such a big incident has happened to you through the same car.

00:06:04.307 --> 00:06:05.920
And secondly, superstition sits in the mind.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:08.059
So we thought that our car should go for total loss.

00:06:08.059 --> 00:06:11.100
Total loss is a situation in which there are
a lot of expenses in the car.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:15.835
Specifically, if the cost is coming around
70-75% of insured declared value.

00:06:15.835 --> 00:06:17.335
Then the company does not repair it.

00:06:17.335 --> 00:06:19.056
It declares it in total loss.

00:06:19.056 --> 00:06:20.875
And we get a return to invoice.

00:06:20.875 --> 00:06:22.298
That is, whatever we have spent.

00:06:22.298 --> 00:06:23.836
Whatever on-road cost we have incurred.

00:06:23.836 --> 00:06:25.184
We get all that back.

00:06:25.184 --> 00:06:27.129
And after that, we can buy a new car.

00:06:27.129 --> 00:06:29.500
After that, the car was surveyed in Mahindra.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:32.595
And they made a quotation of Rs 56 lakhs.

00:06:32.595 --> 00:06:34.437
Now you will say, how the quotation is so high?

00:06:34.437 --> 00:06:36.212
On-road the car costs Rs 33 lakhs.

00:06:36.212 --> 00:06:38.332
Basically, whenever you look at the assembled parts.

00:06:38.332 --> 00:06:40.024
For example, you bought an iPhone worth Rs 1 lakh.

00:06:40.024 --> 00:06:43.537
If you see the board, Camera, Battery, Body,
Screen of a Rs 1,00,000 iPhone.

00:06:43.537 --> 00:06:44.639
If you look at everything separately.

00:06:44.639 --> 00:06:46.664
Then its value will be more than Rs 1 lakh.

00:06:46.664 --> 00:06:49.365
So this happens in cars. 
When quotations of different parts are seen.

00:06:49.365 --> 00:06:51.455
In that, GST, Labour cost is mentioned.

00:06:51.455 --> 00:06:54.210
So basically, they mentioned the cost of the entire car.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:55.784
Because the car was almost totally damage.

00:06:55.784 --> 00:06:58.452
The most expensive components were battery and motor.

00:06:58.452 --> 00:07:00.042
Which are the core components of EV car.

00:07:00.042 --> 00:07:02.277
After that, the insurance surveyor came. 
He checked the car.

00:07:02.277 --> 00:07:05.796
You won't believe, he gave a counter quotation
for only Rs 11 lakhs.

00:07:05.796 --> 00:07:07.194
And said, repair it.

00:07:07.194 --> 00:07:08.231
I asked the Mahindra people.

00:07:08.231 --> 00:07:09.654
Will it be able to be repaired properly?

00:07:09.654 --> 00:07:12.434
They denied on my face and said don't get it repaired.

00:07:12.434 --> 00:07:13.658
Its condition is very bad.

00:07:13.658 --> 00:07:16.257
And for them, this was their first major EV case.

00:07:16.257 --> 00:07:17.352
Which had to be repaired.

00:07:17.352 --> 00:07:19.558
So basically, an experiment was going to be done on my car.

00:07:19.558 --> 00:07:22.997
And these insurance people are so smart. 
That in their counter quotation,

00:07:22.997 --> 00:07:26.400
In that, instead of XEV-9E, they had written XUV700.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:28.345
Those who do not know the information of the car.

00:07:28.345 --> 00:07:29.797
How will they be able to make the quotation correctly?

00:07:29.797 --> 00:07:32.399
I kept fighting for 1.5 months.
I called everyone whom I could.

00:07:32.399 --> 00:07:34.761
I took the contacts of the concerned authorities.

00:07:34.761 --> 00:07:38.089
I took all the advantages of being a YouTuber.

00:07:38.089 --> 00:07:39.704
I took out the contacts of ICICI.

00:07:39.704 --> 00:07:41.310
I took out the contacts of Mahindra.

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:43.673
And after fighting for 1.5 months.

00:07:43.673 --> 00:07:45.339
No one helped me.

00:07:45.339 --> 00:07:48.086
Because in my mind, the biggest doubt was that
firstly this is an EV car.

00:07:48.086 --> 00:07:50.010
Such an impactful accident has happened.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:51.568
The whole thing is sensor based.

00:07:51.568 --> 00:07:52.920
There is a battery in it.

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.884
I don't know what is the case of wiring in it.

00:07:54.884 --> 00:07:56.183
I was so tensed.

00:07:56.183 --> 00:07:58.065
I thought there could be any fault in the car while using it.

00:07:58.065 --> 00:08:00.172
A few days ago, Trackin tech shared on Twitter.

00:08:00.172 --> 00:08:01.455
About their XEV 9V.

00:08:01.455 --> 00:08:02.697
That it stopped while driving.

00:08:02.697 --> 00:08:04.683
You can read their case on Twitter.

00:08:04.683 --> 00:08:05.920
I will put the link in the description.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:08.169
And recently there has been a case of fire in a BE6.

00:08:08.169 --> 00:08:10.651
Whose entire blame they have put on the tire.

00:08:10.651 --> 00:08:11.920
And these are just 2 cases.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:15.920
You can see a lot of such cases of BE6 and
XEV90 on the internet.

00:08:17.992 --> 00:08:19.420
This is with new cars.

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:21.820
And still they are trying to give a repaired car.

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:23.920
And I gave the same argument to them.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.864
But no, they refused it.

00:08:25.864 --> 00:08:27.425
They said that it will be repaired.

00:08:27.425 --> 00:08:29.640
Its cost is not going more than 10-11 lakhs.

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:31.550
They said that 11 lakhs is still on a higher side.

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:33.411
This car will be fixed in less than that.

00:08:33.411 --> 00:08:36.216
So basically my declared value is around 29 lakhs.

00:08:36.216 --> 00:08:39.919
So 70-75% of that is around 19 lakhs.

00:08:39.919 --> 00:08:42.280
So if the cost of repair would have gone up to 19 lakhs.

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:45.250
Then they would have put it for total loss. 
According to their policies.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.185
Now the biggest role here is of the workshop people.

00:08:47.185 --> 00:08:49.661
When the workshop people don't have
enough information about the car.

00:08:49.661 --> 00:08:51.342
Then how will they fight with the insurance company.

00:08:51.342 --> 00:08:53.236
You don't know what to put inside the car.

00:08:53.236 --> 00:08:54.491
What is the cost of that thing.

00:08:54.491 --> 00:08:57.138
Will you be able to counter them?
That it won't be fixed in 10-11 lakhs.

00:08:57.138 --> 00:08:59.839
It can go to a total loss. 
I told this in the Mahindra workshop.

00:08:59.839 --> 00:09:02.276
But they said that no,
The insurance company is not agreeing.

00:09:02.276 --> 00:09:04.937
You do as much expense as you get. 
We will see.

00:09:04.937 --> 00:09:06.585
This is what the insurance company said.

00:09:06.585 --> 00:09:08.552
And from 1st or 2nd September.

00:09:08.552 --> 00:09:10.779
Till 15th, 16th October.

00:09:10.779 --> 00:09:13.767
After continuously fighting for 1.5 months.

00:09:13.767 --> 00:09:15.121
There was no solution.

00:09:15.121 --> 00:09:17.528
On 17th October, I said, you repair it.

00:09:17.528 --> 00:09:20.071
And I wrote a big email that what are my concerns.

00:09:20.071 --> 00:09:22.638
If something will be repaired,
then it should come in my hand.

00:09:22.638 --> 00:09:24.317
So that I don't face a problem the next day.

00:09:24.317 --> 00:09:27.606
Even Mahindra made me contact
the customer care manager here.

00:09:27.606 --> 00:09:30.889
They assured me that they will give you a brand new car.

00:09:30.889 --> 00:09:33.247
You won't even know that your car has been repaired.

00:09:33.247 --> 00:09:36.565
And there will be no problem. 
There will be no risk factor in it.

00:09:36.565 --> 00:09:37.732
And the biggest promise.

00:09:37.732 --> 00:09:40.187
You will get the car within a month.

00:09:40.187 --> 00:09:41.919
You will get it before a month.

00:09:41.919 --> 00:09:44.393
This happened around 17th-18th October.

00:09:44.393 --> 00:09:46.450
That means I should have got it by mid-November.

00:09:46.653 --> 00:09:48.233
I will tell you when I actually got it later.

00:09:48.233 --> 00:09:50.440
And I specifically mentioned to the customer care manager.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.194
That I will make a video on after-sales service.

00:09:52.194 --> 00:09:53.812
So the better the service I get.

00:09:53.812 --> 00:09:55.799
The better the feedback will go to the market.

00:09:55.799 --> 00:09:57.458
So he mentioned that you don't take tension.

00:09:57.458 --> 00:10:00.064
And the logic of keeping this video
factor is totally selfish.

00:10:00.064 --> 00:10:01.373
I wanted a well repaired car

00:10:01.373 --> 00:10:05.159
Because I didn't even drive 100 KMs,
A person who bought a car worth Rs 33 Lakhs.

00:10:05.159 --> 00:10:10.253
Then approximately they took 3 months and
then called me for the first visit to check my car.

00:10:10.253 --> 00:10:13.313
The final touch is pending but we have repaired your car.

00:10:13.313 --> 00:10:15.276
And I took a very long checklist with me

00:10:15.276 --> 00:10:17.940
Because obviously I am a tech YouTuber,
I wanted to see the shortcomings.

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:18.971
The speakers were not working,

00:10:18.971 --> 00:10:21.745
The sensors were not working,
there were many issues in the body paint,

00:10:21.745 --> 00:10:23.191
The wireless charger was not working.

00:10:23.191 --> 00:10:26.714
These were the things that I was able to see
in the first visit in about an hour.

00:10:26.714 --> 00:10:29.235
And I told them about 20-40 issues,

00:10:29.235 --> 00:10:31.879
From the body to the internal parts
and told them that you will have to get it repaired.

00:10:31.879 --> 00:10:36.137
Then they took 8-10 more days,
called me for another visit, Then I checked it,

00:10:36.137 --> 00:10:38.846
Among all the shortcomings I told to them
and only a few of them were solved.

00:10:38.846 --> 00:10:40.487
The rest of the problems were as it is,

00:10:40.487 --> 00:10:43.836
I told them again that I am not enjoying the service,
You at least repair this,

00:10:43.836 --> 00:10:46.386
You are calling me to show the car,
At least repair it properly.

00:10:46.386 --> 00:10:50.502
Seriously, looking at the body paint, it looked like
it was painted from a roadside shop.

00:10:50.502 --> 00:10:53.885
And after that, I didn't talk to them about the third visit,
